# Working notes and development history — kept locally, not published.
#
# Every one of these is anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, `design/` also
# matches `frontend/src/app/design/` and `fixtures/` also matches
# `backend/fixtures/` — so a new component or a newly recorded distributor response
# would be silently ignored, invisible to `git status`, and simply absent from the
# next clone. Both were, until this was measured.
/RUN.md
/BUILD_LOG.md
/design/
/fixtures/
/docs/DEFERRED.md
/docs/BUILD_STEPS.md
/docs/STATUS.md
/docs/specs/

# Playwright MCP snapshots and screenshots from local browser checks.
.playwright-mcp/
test-results/
playwright-report/
